GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan0_Text:
	.string "This is my third CONVENTION!\nI've got every LEADER's\pautograph but LANCE's.\pHe keeps flying off on his\nDRAGONITE before I can catch\phim!$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan1::
	msgbox GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan1_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan1_Text:
	.string "LEADERS from Kanto, Johto,\nHoenn, Sinnoh... even Paldea!\pI never dreamed I'd see them all\nunder one roof.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan2::
	msgbox GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan2_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan2_Text:
	.string "My favorite is WHITNEY! Okay, so\nher MILTANK made me cry.\pShe's still my favorite!$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan3::
	msgbox GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan3_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Johto_EventScript_ConventionFan3_Text:
	.string "BRUNO and CHUCK have been\narm-wrestling in the FIGHTING\pHALL since this morning.\nNobody's winning.$"
